   {
    "id": "blockquote_00002",
    "type": "blockquote",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     13
    ],
    "text": "fflush — flush a stream",
    "placeholders": {},
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "h4_00003",
    "type": "h4",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     15
    ],
    "text": "[A2][/A2]SYNOPSIS",
    "placeholders": {
     "A2": {
      "open": "<a name=\"tag_17_154_02\" id=\"tag_17_154_02\">",
      "close": "</a>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00004",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     17,
     1
    ],
    "text": "[CODE3]",
    "placeholders": {
     "CODE3": {
      "open": "",
      "close": "",
      "translate": false,
      "raw": "<code><tt>#include &lt;<a href=\"../basedefs/stdio.h.html\">stdio.h</a>&gt;<br>\n<br>\nint fflush(FILE *</tt><i>stream</i><tt>);<br></tt></code>"
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "h4_00005",
    "type": "h4",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     19
    ],
    "text": "[A4][/A4]DESCRIPTION",
    "placeholders": {
     "A4": {
      "open": "<a name=\"tag_17_154_03\" id=\"tag_17_154_03\">",
      "close": "</a>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00006",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     21,
     3
    ],
    "text": "If [I5]stream[/I5] points to an output stream or an update stream in which the most recent operation was not input,\n[I6]fflush[/I6]() shall cause any unwritten data for that stream to be written to the file, [S7][[A8]CX[/A8]][/S7] [IMG9] &nbsp;and the last\ndata modification and last file status change timestamps of the underlying file shall be marked for update.",
    "placeholders": {
     "I5": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I6": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "S7": {
      "open": "<sup>",
      "close": "</sup>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "A8": {
      "open": "<a href=\"javascript:open_code(&#x27;CX&#x27;)\">",
      "close": "</a>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "IMG9": {
      "open": "",
      "close": "",
      "translate": false,
      "raw": "<img src=\"../images/opt-start.gif\" alt=\"[Option Start]\" border=\"0\">"
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00007",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     21,
     5
    ],
    "text": "For a stream open for reading with an underlying file description, if the file is not already at EOF, and the file is one\ncapable of seeking, the file offset of the underlying open file description shall be set to the file position of the stream, and\nany characters pushed back onto the stream by [A10][I11]ungetc[/I11]()[/A10] or [A12][I13]ungetwc[/I13]()[/A12] that have not subsequently been read from the stream shall be discarded (without\nfurther changing the file offset). [IMG14]",
    "placeholders": {
     "A10": {
      "open": "<a href=\"../functions/ungetc.html\">",
      "close": "</a>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I11": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "A12": {
      "open": "<a href=\"../functions/ungetwc.html\">",
      "close": "</a>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I13": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "IMG14": {
      "open": "",
      "close": "",
      "translate": false,
      "raw": "<img src=\"../images/opt-end.gif\" alt=\"[Option End]\" border=\"0\">"
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00008",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     21,
     7
    ],
    "text": "If [I15]stream[/I15] is a null pointer, [I16]fflush[/I16]() shall perform this flushing action on all streams for which the behavior is\ndefined above.",
    "placeholders": {
     "I15": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I16": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "h4_00009",
    "type": "h4",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     23
    ],
    "text": "[A17][/A17]RETURN VALUE",
    "placeholders": {
     "A17": {
      "open": "<a name=\"tag_17_154_04\" id=\"tag_17_154_04\">",
      "close": "</a>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00010",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     25,
     1
    ],
    "text": "Upon successful completion, [I18]fflush[/I18]() shall return 0; otherwise, it shall set the error indicator for the stream, return\nEOF, [S19][[A20]CX[/A20]][/S19] [IMG21]\n&nbsp;and set [I22]errno[/I22] to indicate the error. [IMG23]",
    "placeholders": {
     "I18": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "S19": {
      "open": "<sup>",
      "close": "</sup>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "A20": {
      "open": "<a href=\"javascript:open_code(&#x27;CX&#x27;)\">",
      "close": "</a>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "IMG21": {
      "open": "",
      "close": "",
      "translate": false,
      "raw": "<img src=\"../images/opt-start.gif\" alt=\"[Option Start]\" border=\"0\">"
     },
     "I22": {
